sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant C as Chat Service
    participant V as Vector DB
    participant B as BGE Reranker
    participant G as Gemini API

    autonumber
    U->>F: Send message
    F->>A: Forward request (HTTP)
    A->>C: Route request (gRPC)
    C->>V: Retrieve Top-15 chunks
    V-->>C: Return raw chunks
    C->>B: Send Query + Raw Chunks
    B-->>C: Return Top-5 Scored Chunks
    C->>G: Generate answer with Refined Context

    alt Confidence High
        G-->>C: Final Answer
        C-->>A: Return Answer
        A-->>F: Deliver Answer
        F-->>U: Display Answer
    else Confidence Low
        G-->>C: Low Confidence Flag
        C-->>A: Suggest "Contact Staff"
        A-->>F: Show Contact Button
        F-->>U: Prompt to contact official staff
    end

    Note over C, G: Total Latency <= 5 seconds
